code_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1057301-magical-girls-am-i-high?p=1057361#post1057361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">HA FOUND IT! IM NOT THAT HIGH!! Senshi: The Merchandising</div> </div> </div> </div>ANCIENT BEYOND RECKONING<br /> <br /> Literally, it was introduced on the internet some time before H:tR, in the dial-up years.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T01:55:12-08:00","id":1057499,"title":"","content":"5 School girls with wild colored hair and matching outfits, each with Martial Arts 4 or 5, each gaining a free dot in their chosen Qiao every session.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5818-eviltyger","name":"EvilTyger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T04:10:40-08:00","id":1057527,"title":"","content":"I love Senshi: The Merchandising and consider it part of my WoD head-canon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T15:16:55-08:00","id":1057780,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1057301-magical-girls-am-i-high?p=1057336#post1057336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While it may cause screaming fits, how would you do 'magic girl' in cWoD?</div> </div> </div> </div>I always preferred the rules for Kami (or Fomori, if you prefer a darker spin on it). <br /> <br /> The idea as a character concept works pretty well for Kitsune, Akashics, and some Changelings, I think. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T18:25:34-08:00","id":1057860,"title":"","content":"Or Mages. I'm reminded of Madoka Magica, and how it could easily transfer to how many Mages in WoD are Awakened by Spirits...who very well may terribly misinform their mortal playthings.<br /> <br /> On a more general note, magical girls could be run as Awakened easily, so long as you're willing to play against type for World of Darkness characters. Indeed, M20 has an entire Paradigm - &quot;It's All Good, Have Faith!&quot; - that draws magical power from telling Despair to stuff itself. That espouses the virtue of being positive in the face of negativity. Practices like Witchcraft, Martial Arts, Faith, Crazy Wisdom, Art of Desire, Chaos or Gutter Magick, and possibly Hypertech or Reality Hacking could fit, depending on the exact flavor of magical girl you're going for. Give them Wands, Fashion, Gems and Jewelry, Dance and Body Movements, Music, and Voice as Instruments, and you've only scratched the conceptual surface of what tools can be used in the name of Justice, Love, and Friendship. Hell, some magical girls (or boys) could use their Friends - and the relationships they have with them - as tools for channeling magic.<br /> <br /> Give them a few gaudy Wonders and a Familiar, and you're well on your way to running a proper magical girl Mage.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-22T12:41:43-07:00","id":1066529,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/archive/index.php/t-265036.html\" target=\"_blank\">This reminds me of an ancient RPG.net thread.</a><br /> <br /> My favorite highlight:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Old Toby</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Jenny: The shining leader of the pack, and a cheerleader!<br /> Megan: The geeky yet hot computer nerd!<br /> Isis: The spooky goth chick!<br /> Cass: The caring, passionate, hippy chick!<br /> Keiko: She's Asian, she's a Buddhist, she knows kung fu!<br /> Shantiqua: She may come from the wrong side of the tracks, but her sass and can-do keep the team going!<br /> Maria: She's into that Santaria stuff!<br /> Svetlana: A firey Russian dynamo with mob ties, a penchant for bondage gear, and a heart of gold!<br /> Sif: An icy Nordic headbanger, with a heart of gold!<br /> Flying Horse: An angry Native American with a chip on her shoulder and a heart of gold!<br /> Erin: A fiesty Celtic beauty with a song in her heart of gold!<br /> Lilith: A feminist Riot Grrl with... aw, you guessed it.<br /> Socks: I don't think she actually goes to school...</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5553-mr-sluagh","name":"Mr. Sluagh","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}